\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 1. PRINCIPIILE FUNDAMENTALE ALE PRELUCR\uc0\u258 RII DATELOR\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \'cen calitate de furnizor al unei solu\uc0\u539 ii ERP (Enterprise Resource Planning) Mobile, recunoa\u537 tem importan\u539 a critic\u259  a datelor de business \u537 i a datelor cu caracter personal introduse \'een sistemul nostru. Prelucrarea datelor se realizeaz\u259  \'een conformitate cu:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Regulamentul (UE) 2016/679 (GDPR)
\f1\b0  privind protec\uc0\u539 ia persoanelor fizice \'een ceea ce prive\u537 te prelucrarea datelor cu caracter personal.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Legea nr. 190/2018
\f1\b0  privind m\uc0\u259 suri de punere \'een aplicare a GDPR \'een Rom\'e2nia.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ghidurile de revizuire ale Apple App Store
\f1\b0  (App Store Review Guidelines), \'een special Sec\uc0\u539 iunea 5.1 privind Confiden\u539 ialitatea \u537 i Securitatea Datelor.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 2. ROLUL NOSTRU: OPERATOR VS. \'ceMPUTERNICIT (DATA PROCESSOR)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Este esen\uc0\u539 ial s\u259  se fac\u259  distinc\u539 ia \'eentre cele dou\u259  moduri \'een care datele sunt gestionate \'een cadrul Aplica\u539 iei ERP Mobile:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Noi ca Operator (Data Controller):
\f1\b0  Suntem operatori pentru datele colectate \'een scopul administr\uc0\u259 rii rela\u539 iei comerciale cu compania dumneavoastr\u259  (date de facturare ale clientului persoan\u259  juridic\u259 , datele de contact ale administratorilor/reprezentan\u539 ilor legali, datele contului de utilizator Master).\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Noi ca \'cemputernicit (Data Processor):
\f1\b0  Pentru toate datele de business introduse de utilizatori \'een modulele ERP (datele angaja\uc0\u539 ilor clien\u539 ilor no\u537 tri, datele clien\u539 ilor finali ai utilizatorului, facturi, salarii, stocuri, fi\u537 e medicale, etc.), 
\f0\b Clientul nostru (Angajatorul/Compania dumneavoastr\uc0\u259 ) este Operatorul de date
\f1\b0 , iar Noi suntem doar un \'cemputernicit care ofer\uc0\u259  infrastructura tehnic\u259 . 
\f2\i Aceast\uc0\u259  politic\u259  reglementeaz\u259  ambele aspecte, \'eens\u259  drepturile angaja\u539 ilor cu privire la datele introduse \'een ERP de c\u259 tre companie trebuie exercitate direct c\u259 tre angajator.
\f1\i0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 3. CATEGORIILE DE DATE COLECTATE \uc0\u536 I MODALITATEA DE COLECTARE\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Aplica\uc0\u539 ia colecteaz\u259  mai multe tipuri de informa\u539 ii, \'een func\u539 ie de modulele ERP activate \u537 i de permisiunile acordate pe dispozitivul iOS:\
