\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 7. M\uc0\u258 SURI DE SECURITATE CONFORM STANDARDELOR APPLE \u536 I ENISA\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Securitatea datelor de business este prioritatea noastr\uc0\u259  absolut\u259 . Am implementat m\u259 suri tehnice \u537 i organizatorice avansate, inclusiv, dar f\u259 r\u259  a se limita la:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Criptare \'een Tranzit (Data in Transit):
\f1\b0  Toate comunica\uc0\u539 iile dintre Aplica\u539 ia iOS \u537 i serverele noastre API se realizeaz\u259  prin protocoale securizate HTTPS cu criptare 
\f0\b TLS 1.3
\f1\b0  \uc0\u537 i tehnici de 
\f2\i SSL Pinning
\f1\i0  pentru a preveni atacurile de tip Man-in-the-Middle (MitM).\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Criptare \'een Repaus (Data at Rest):
\f1\b0  Baza de date central\uc0\u259  este criptat\u259  utiliz\'e2nd algoritmul 
\f0\b AES-256
\f1\b0 . Datele salvate local pe dispozitivul iOS (cache-ul aplica\uc0\u539 iei) sunt stocate \'een 
\f0\b iOS Keychain
\f1\b0  \uc0\u537 i sunt protejate prin criptarea nativ\u259  oferit\u259  de Apple la nivel de hardware.\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Controlul Accesului:
\f1\b0  Autentificare multifactor (MFA/2FA) obligatorie sau op\uc0\u539 ional\u259  pentru utilizatori, politici stricte de parole \u537 i control al accesului bazat pe roluri (RBAC - Role-Based Access Control).\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Audituri de Securitate:
\f1\b0  Realiz\uc0\u259 m periodic teste de penetrare (Pen-Testing) \u537 i scan\u259 ri de vulnerabilit\u259 \u539 i pe infrastructura ERP.\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Izolarea Datelor (Multi-Tenancy):
