\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Dreptul la restric\uc0\u539 ionarea prelucr\u259 rii (Art. 18):
\f1\b0  Pute\uc0\u539 i cere blocarea temporar\u259  a prelucr\u259 rii datelor \'een anumite cazuri.\
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
