\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Dreptul de opozi\uc0\u539 ie (Art. 21):
\f1\b0  V\uc0\u259  pute\u539 i opune prelucr\u259 rilor bazate pe interesul nostru legitim din motive legate de situa\u539 ia dumneavoastr\u259  particular\u259 .\
