\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Dreptul de a nu fi supus unei decizii individuale automatizate (Art. 22):
\f1\b0  Aplica\uc0\u539 ia noastr\u259  nu utilizeaz\u259  algoritmi de profiling sau decizii 100% automatizate care s\u259  produc\u259  efecte juridice asupra dumneavoastr\u259 .\
